### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Quran Centers API — manual test script
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### and JetBrains HTTP Client. Click "Send Request" above each block.
### Run them top-to-bottom: the create request stores the new id in {{centerId}}.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/centers
@adminSecret = change-me-to-a-long-random-string

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Create a center (admin)
# @name createCenter
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{
  "name": "دار الإخلاص لتحفيظ القرآن",
  "address": "شارع التحرير، بجوار مسجد النور",
  "region": "القاهرة",
  "whatsappNumber": "+20 100 123 4567",
  "details": "حلقات للأطفال والكبار، تجويد وتحفيظ بالسند المتصل."
}

### Captured id from the response above
@centerId = {{createCenter.response.body.data.id}}

### 3. Create WITHOUT admin secret → expect 401
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "x", "address": "x", "region": "x", "whatsappNumber": "201000000000" }

### 4. Create with missing fields → expect 400 + details[]
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{ "name": "دار ناقصة" }

### 5. List all centers (default: page 1, limit 20, newest first)
GET {{api}}

### 6. Filter by region
GET {{api}}?region=القاهرة

### 7. Search (matches name/address/region/details, tolerant of أ/ا, ة/ه, ى/ي)
GET {{api}}?search=الاخلاص

### 8. Combined filter + pagination + sorting
GET {{api}}?region=القاهرة&search=تحفيظ&page=1&limit=10&sort=popular

### 9. Distinct regions (for a dropdown)
GET {{api}}/regions

### 10. Get one center → cardClicks +1
GET {{api}}/{{centerId}}

### 11. Get one center WITHOUT counting a view
GET {{api}}/{{centerId}}?track=false

### 12. Track card click explicitly
POST {{api}}/{{centerId}}/card-click

### 13. Track WhatsApp click
POST {{api}}/{{centerId}}/whatsapp-click

### 14. Partial update (admin)
PATCH {{api}}/{{centerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{
  "details": "تمت إضافة حلقات مسائية للنساء.",
  "whatsappNumber": "201112223334"
}

### 15. Invalid id → expect 400
GET {{api}}/not-a-valid-id

### 16. Unknown id → expect 404
GET {{api}}/000000000000000000000000

### 17. Delete (admin)
DELETE {{api}}/{{centerId}}
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}
